<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Guia Mines - Loritta</title>
    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background-color: #1e1f22;
            color: #ffffff;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 20px 15px;
        }

        .container {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 400px;
            background-color: #2b2d31;
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
            border: 1px solid #3f4147;
        }

        header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
        }

        header h1 {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            color: #f2f3f5;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        header p {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: #b5bac1;
            margin-top: 4px;
        }

        .controls {
            display: flex;
            gap: 8px;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        .btn {
            flex: 1;
            padding: 10px;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: 0.2s;
            color: white;
        }

        .btn-reset {
            background-color: #5865f2;
        }

        .btn-reset:active {
            background-color: #4752c4;
        }

        .btn-safe {
            background-color: #23a55a;
        }

        .btn-safe:active {
            background-color: #1a7f44;
        }

        .grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
            gap: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            background-color: #1e1f22;
            padding: 12px;
            border-radius: 12px;
        }

        .cell {
            aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
            border-radius: 10px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-weight: bold;
            cursor: pointer;
            user-select: none;
            transition: transform 0.1s, opacity 0.2s;
            position: relative;
            border: 2px solid transparent;
        }

        .cell:active {
            transform: scale(0.93);
        }

        .cell.clicked {
            opacity: 0.35;
            transform: scale(0.95);
        }

        .cell .ordem {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            line-height: 1;
        }

        .cell .chance {
            font-size: 0.7rem;
            margin-top: 4px;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }

        /* Cores por nível de segurança */
        .top-safe {
            background-color: #1f8b4c;
            border-color: #2ecc71;
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        .good-safe {
            background-color: #237a57;
            border-color: #3ba55c;
            color: #e8f8f5;
        }

        .neutral {
            background-color: #9c6b19;
            border-color: #f0b232;
            color: #fff8e7;
        }

        .danger {
            background-color: #8f2429;
            border-color: #f23f43;
            color: #ffd6d7;
        }

        .highlight-dim {
            opacity: 0.2;
        }

        .legend {
            background-color: #1e1f22;
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 12px;
            font-size: 0.82rem;
            line-height: 1.5;
            color: #dbdee1;
        }

        .legend-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }

        .legend-item:last-child {
            margin-bottom: 0;
        }

        .dot {
            width: 12px;
            height: 12px;
            border-radius: 3px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .tip-box {
            margin-top: 14px;
            background-color: rgba(88, 101, 242, 0.15);
            border-left: 4px solid #5865f2;
            padding: 10px 12px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: #e3e5e8;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="container">
        <header>
            <h1>💣 Guia Mines (Loritta)</h1>
            <p>Baseado nas suas 20 partidas (3 Minas)</p>
        </header>

        <div class="controls">
            <button class="btn btn-safe" onclick="destacarTop5()">💎 Destacar Top 5</button>
            <button class="btn btn-reset" onclick="resetarTabuleiro()">🔄 Limpar Cliques</button>
        </div>

        <div class="grid" id="tabuleiro">
            <!-- Linha 1 -->
            <div class="cell danger" onclick="marcar(this)">
                <span class="ordem">❌</span>
                <span class="chance">75%</span>
            </div>
            <div class="cell good-safe top5" onclick="marcar(this)">
                <span class="ordem">4º</span>
                <span class="chance">85%</span>
            </div>
            <div class="cell top-safe top5" onclick="marcar(this)">
                <span class="ordem">2º</span>
                <span class="chance">90%</span>
            </div>
            <div class="cell top-safe top5" onclick="marcar(this)">
                <span class="ordem">1º</span>
                <span class="chance">95%</span>
            </div>

            <!-- Linha 2 -->
            <div class="cell good-safe top5" onclick="marcar(this)">
                <span class="ordem">5º</span>
                <span class="chance">85%</span>
            </div>
            <div class="cell neutral" onclick="marcar(this)">
                <span class="ordem">⚠️</span>
                <span class="chance">80%</span>
            </div>
            <div class="cell neutral" onclick="marcar(this)">
                <span class="ordem">⚠️</span>
                <span class="chance">80%</span>
            </div>
            <div class="cell danger" onclick="marcar(this)">
                <span class="ordem">❌</span>
                <span class="chance">60%</span>
            </div>

            <!-- Linha 3 -->
            <div class="cell good-safe" onclick="marcar(this)">
                <span class="ordem">6º</span>
                <span class="chance">85%</span>
            </div>
            <div class="cell top-safe top5" onclick="marcar(this)">
                <span class="ordem">3º</span>
                <span class="chance">90%</span>
            </div>
            <div class="cell neutral" onclick="marcar(this)">
                <span class="ordem">⚠️</span>
                <span class="chance">80%</span>
            </div>
            <div class="cell good-safe" onclick="marcar(this)">
                <span class="ordem">7º</span>
                <span class="chance">85%</span>
            </div>

            <!-- Linha 4 -->
            <div class="cell good-safe" onclick="marcar(this)">
                <span class="ordem">8º</span>
                <span class="chance">85%</span>
            </div>
            <div class="cell danger" onclick="marcar(this)">
                <span class="ordem">❌</span>
                <span class="chance">70%</span>
            </div>
            <div class="cell danger" onclick="marcar(this)">
                <span class="ordem">❌</span>
                <span class="chance">70%</span>
            </div>
            <div class="cell good-safe" onclick="marcar(this)">
                <span class="ordem">9º</span>
                <span class="chance">85%</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="legend">
            <div class="legend-item">
                <div class="dot" style="background:#2ecc71;"></div>
                <span><strong>1º ao 3º (Verde Claro):</strong> Melhores lugares para começar.</span>
            </div>
            <div class="legend-item">
                <div class="dot" style="background:#3ba55c;"></div>
                <span><strong>4º ao 9º (Verde Escuro):</strong> Bons para continuar o lucro.</span>
            </div>
            <div class="legend-item">
                <div class="dot" style="background:#f0b232;"></div>
                <span><strong>⚠️ (Amarelo):</strong> Risco médio. Evite se puder.</span>
            </div>
            <div class="legend-item">
                <div class="dot" style="background:#f23f43;"></div>
                <span><strong>❌ (Vermelho):</strong> Onde mais caíram bombas. Não clique!</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="tip-box">
            💡 <strong>Dica de Ouro:</strong> Pare no <strong>4º clique (2,47x)</strong> ou no <strong>6º clique (4,53x)</strong> e retire seus sonhos antes que a bomba apareça.
        </div>
    </div>

    <script>
        let modoTop5 = false;

        function marcar(elemento) {
            elemento.classList.toggle('clicked');
        }

        function resetarTabuleiro() {
            const celulas = document.querySelectorAll('.cell');
            celulas.forEach(cell => {
                cell.classList.remove('clicked');
                cell.classList.remove('highlight-dim');
            });
            modoTop5 = false;
        }

        function destacarTop5() {
            const celulas = document.querySelectorAll('.cell');
            modoTop5 = !modoTop5;

            celulas.forEach(cell => {
                if (modoTop5) {
                    if (!cell.classList.contains('top5')) {
                        cell.classList.add('highlight-dim');
